      "shots": [
        {
          "id": "S01",
          "narration_id": "N01",
          "text": "她问AI：安眠药加酒，会不会死？",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.307,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.89,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.78,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.78,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 0.03,
          "speech_end": 3.81,
          "characters": 13,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.6
        },
        {
          "id": "S02",
          "narration_id": "N01",
          "text": "AI说：可能致命。她看完，继续加大了药量。",
          "start": 5.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.074,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.75,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.64,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.64,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 5.03,
          "speech_end": 9.67,
          "characters": 17,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.4
        },
        {
          "id": "S03",
          "narration_id": "N02",
          "text": "2025年12月，首尔江北区，金某让男友喝下掺了药的饮料。",
          "start": 10.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.606,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.24,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.13,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.13,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 10.03,
          "speech_end": 16.16,
          "characters": 26,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.714
        },
        {
          "id": "S04",
          "narration_id": "N02",
          "text": "他昏迷了两天才醒来，当时，她没有被追责。",
          "start": 17.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.725,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.41,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.3,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.3,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 17.03,
          "speech_end": 21.33,
          "characters": 17,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.429
        },
        {
          "id": "S05",
          "narration_id": "N02",
          "text": "她没有收手，转头又问AI：药检，能查出来吗？",
          "start": 24.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.827,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.41,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.3,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.78,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0919,
          "speech_start": 24.03,
          "speech_end": 29.81,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S06",
          "narration_id": "N02",
          "text": "她把AI的回答，记在了心里。",
          "start": 30.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 3.239,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 2.88,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 2.77,
          "spoken_seconds": 2.77,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 30.03,
          "speech_end": 32.8,
          "characters": 12,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.4
        },
        {
          "id": "S07",
          "narration_id": "N03",
          "text": "2026年1月28日晚九点半，江北区水踰洞的一家汽车旅馆。",
          "start": 35.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 8.696,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 8.29,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 8.18,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.76,
          "tempo_factor": 1.2092,
          "speech_start": 35.03,
          "speech_end": 41.79,
          "characters": 27,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.857
        },
        {
          "id": "S08",
          "narration_id": "N03",
          "text": "她陪着一位二十多岁的男子走了进去，前台递出一张门卡。",
          "start": 42.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.41,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.14,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.03,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.03,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 42.03,
          "speech_end": 47.06,
          "characters": 24,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.429
        },
        {
          "id": "S09",
          "narration_id": "N03",
          "text": "两个小时后，有人看到她一个人走了出来。",
          "start": 49.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 3.831,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.54,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.43,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.43,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 49.03,
          "speech_end": 52.46,
          "characters": 17,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.833
        },
        {
          "id": "S10",
          "narration_id": "N03",
          "text": "第二天，男子被发现死在了房间的床上。",
          "start": 55.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.598,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.36,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.25,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.25,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 55.03,
          "speech_end": 59.28,
          "characters": 16,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.2
        },
        {
          "id": "S11",
          "narration_id": "N04",
          "text": "仅仅十二天后，2月9日，同样的旅馆街，另一名男子也再没有醒来。",
          "start": 60.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 7.6,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 7.18,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 7.07,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.77,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0443,
          "speech_start": 60.03,
          "speech_end": 66.8,
          "characters": 27,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.857
        },
        {
          "id": "S12",
          "narration_id": "N04",
          "text": "2月11日清晨，警察在公寓楼下抓到了她，她没有逃跑。",
          "start": 67.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.201,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.83,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.72,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.72,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 67.03,
          "speech_end": 71.75,
          "characters": 23,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.286
        },
        {
          "id": "S13",
          "narration_id": "N04",
          "text": "她说：我们吵了一架，我只是想让他睡着。",
          "start": 74.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.47,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.24,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.13,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.13,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 74.03,
          "speech_end": 78.16,
          "characters": 16,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.667
        },
        {
          "id": "S14",
          "narration_id": "N04",
          "text": "直到警察联系我，我才知道他死了。",
          "start": 80.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 3.32,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.05,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 2.94,
          "spoken_seconds": 2.94,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 80.03,
          "speech_end": 82.97,
          "characters": 14,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.8
        },
        {
          "id": "S15",
          "narration_id": "N05",
          "text": "起初，她面对的只是伤害致死，她以为就这样了。",
          "start": 85.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.899,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.62,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.51,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.51,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 85.03,
          "speech_end": 89.54,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
        },
        {
          "id": "S16",
          "narration_id": "N05",
          "text": "可第二天，警察打开了她的手机，里面有一长串聊天记录。",
          "start": 91.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.631,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.31,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.2,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.2,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 91.03,
          "speech_end": 96.23,
          "characters": 23,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.833
        },
        {
          "id": "S17",
          "narration_id": "N05",
          "text": "她反复问AI：过量会不会致死，药和酒一起会怎样？",
          "start": 97.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.329,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.92,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.81,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.81,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 97.03,
          "speech_end": 101.84,
          "characters": 21,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.5
        },
        {
          "id": "S18",
          "narration_id": "N05",
          "text": "AI明确回答：可能致命。而她后来，加大了药量。",
          "start": 103.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.177,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.96,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.85,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.8,
          "tempo_factor": 1.2224,
          "speech_start": 103.03,
          "speech_end": 107.83,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.8
        },
        {
          "id": "S19",
          "narration_id": "N06",
          "text": "警方还发现，她在作案前，已在家里提前调好了饮料。",
          "start": 108.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.201,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.93,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.82,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.82,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 108.03,
          "speech_end": 112.85,
          "characters": 21,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.5
        },
        {
          "id": "S20",
          "narration_id": "N06",
          "text": "国立科学搜查研究院，检出了死者体内的药物成分。",
          "start": 114.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.725,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.31,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.2,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.2,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 114.03,
          "speech_end": 118.23,
          "characters": 21,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.5
        },
        {
          "id": "S21",
          "narration_id": "N06",
          "text": "伤害致死，变成了杀人，罪名彻底反转。",
          "start": 120.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.899,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.61,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.5,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.5,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 120.03,
          "speech_end": 124.53,
          "characters": 15,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S22",
          "narration_id": "N06",
          "text": "2026年3月，她被提起公诉，等待审判。",
          "start": 125.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.516,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.22,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.11,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.11,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 125.03,
          "speech_end": 129.14,
          "characters": 17,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.4
        },
        {
          "id": "S23",
          "narration_id": "N07",
          "text": "案发后，她的社交账号十天涨粉，从两百涨到一万多。",
          "start": 130.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.223,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.95,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.84,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.84,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 130.03,
          "speech_end": 135.87,
          "characters": 21,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S24",
          "narration_id": "N07",
          "text": "评论区里，不少人在写：颜值即正义，点赞数暴涨。",
          "start": 137.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.457,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.14,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.03,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.03,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 137.03,
          "speech_end": 142.06,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.714
        },
        {
          "id": "S25",
          "narration_id": "N07",
          "text": "一半在为受害者哀悼，另一半，却在为凶手点赞。",
          "start": 144.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.12,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.78,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.67,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.67,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 144.03,
          "speech_end": 148.7,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
        },
        {
          "id": "S26",
          "narration_id": "N08",
          "text": "法庭上，她说自己不记得那些对话，语气平静。",
          "start": 150.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.516,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.23,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.12,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.12,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 150.03,
          "speech_end": 154.15,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S27",
          "narration_id": "N08",
          "text": "法官不信：你记得每个细节，却唯独忘了这些？",
          "start": 156.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.516,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.23,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.12,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.12,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 156.03,
          "speech_end": 160.15,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S28",
          "narration_id": "N08",
          "text": "8月27日，她被判无期徒刑，检方要求死刑，双方都已上诉。",
          "start": 162.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.432,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.98,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.87,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.78,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0169,
          "speech_start": 162.03,
          "speech_end": 167.81,
          "characters": 24,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S29",
          "narration_id": "N09",
          "text": "AI警告过她，她没有听。",
          "start": 168.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 2.81,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 2.51,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 2.4,
          "spoken_seconds": 2.4,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 168.03,
          "speech_end": 170.43,
          "characters": 10,
          "target_chars_per_second": 1.667
        },
        {
          "id": "S30",
          "narration_id": "N09",
          "text": "你觉得，当一个人铁了心，一句警告，拦得住吗？",
          "start": 174.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.027,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.77,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.66,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.66,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 174.03,
          "speech_end": 178.69,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        }
      ],
